# === PRIVACY GUARD ===
# This repo publishes the SYSTEM only. Never commit personal/confidential content.
# Even though content is meant to live elsewhere, these rules are a safety net.

# Any real notes / sources dropped into the structure folders (keep only .gitkeep)
raw/**
!raw/assets/.gitkeep
!raw/.gitkeep
00_Inbox/**
!00_Inbox/.gitkeep
10_Progetti/**
!10_Progetti/.gitkeep
20_Aree/**
!20_Aree/.gitkeep
30_Risorse/**
!30_Risorse/Concetti/.gitkeep
40_Archivio/**
!40_Archivio/.gitkeep
50_Diario/**
!50_Diario/Daily/.gitkeep
!50_Diario/Weekly_Review/.gitkeep

# Obsidian workspace + local config
.obsidian/

# Agent memory / logs / index (personal)
MEMORY.md
memory/
index.md
log.md

# Voice models (large, downloadable)
tools/piper_voices/
*.onnx
*.onnx.json
*.mp3
*.wav

# Python / OS junk
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.venv/

# === HARD BLOCK: client / employer material (added 2026-08-06) ===
# Belt-and-braces: block by FILENAME anywhere in the tree, not just by folder.
# The folder rules above miss repo root and 99_Meta — these do not.
*PwC*
*pwc*
*Spec-Driven*
*spec-driven*
*SpecDriven*
*CCB*
*Allitude*
*Anagrafe*
*BIAN*
*AFU*
*riservato*
*confidential*
**/deliverables/**

# 99_Meta: publish templates only, never working meta content
99_Meta/**
!99_Meta/Templates/
!99_Meta/Templates/.gitkeep

# No stray notes at repo root (only the system files below are allowed)
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md

